'''Rainbow Gun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Rainbow Gun Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Rainbow Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux from the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The gun takes the shape of a tactical revolver. The frame of the gun is white with a cloud-resembling design, connecting to the white frame and barrel. The barrel itself has golden patches on it and a golden trigger is beneath it. The body of the gun is coloured with the traditional hues of the rainbow: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo and violet. Below the gold handle is a cloud white plate, and behind the frame is the golden curved hammer. 

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Rainbow Set|Rainbow Set]].
*This and its partner knife are the fifth gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

